{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2022-02-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'NUCOR COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF CALIFORNIA STEEL INDUSTRIES', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., FEB. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED ITS ACQUISITION OF A MAJORITY OWNERSHIP POSITION IN CALIFORNIA STEEL INDUSTRIES, INC. (CSI) BY PURCHASING A 50% EQUITY INTEREST FROM A SUBSIDIARY OF VALE S.A.'}